    <div id="gameOverModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4 overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl max-w-lg w-full p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl border-4 border-amber-400 text-center my-auto">
            
            <div class="text-5xl mb-1">🏆</div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-800 mb-1">สรุปผลการแข่งขัน</h2>
            <p id="gameOverReasonText" class="text-slate-500 text-xs sm:text-sm mb-6 font-bold">ภารกิจพิชิตสมรรถภาพทางกาย สำเร็จลุล่วง!</p>

            <!-- Winner Podium Top 3 -->
            <div id="podiumContainer" class="flex justify-center items-end gap-2 sm:gap-4 mb-6 min-h-[140px] pt-4 border-b pb-6">
